+  // BoardCheck patch: XNNPACK runtimes keep the pthreadpool pointer they were
+  // created with, so destroying the pool while models are loaded leaves them
+  // pointing at freed memory. Create the pool ONCE, as large as
+  // EXECUTORCH_MAX_THREADS allows, and afterwards only change how many of its
